---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  updated="September 2026"
  description="How Wyzer handles data. We collect as little as possible and have no user accounts."
>
  <p>
    Wyzer is a compliance intelligence company. This policy covers our website,
    which includes the marketing pages, this legal section, and the free
    Compliance Navigator reference. There are no user accounts, and we collect as
    little information as possible.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    You do not need an account to use the site. The only personal information we
    collect is what you choose to give us:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Waitlist.</strong> If you join the waitlist, we store the email
      address you submit so we can contact you about early access. You can ask us
      to remove it at any time by emailing us.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Search.</strong> Searching the Navigator runs entirely in your
      browser. Your search queries are not sent to or stored on a server.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Server logs.</strong> Like most websites, our hosting provider may
      automatically record standard request information (such as IP address and
      user agent) to serve pages and protect the service. These logs are not
      used to identify you.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Analytics.</strong> With your consent, we use Google Analytics 4 to
      measure aggregate, anonymous usage. It sets cookies and processes data in
      line with Google's policies; we enable IP anonymization. See our
      <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a> for details and how to opt out.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
  <p>
    We use analytics cookies as described in our
    <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a>. We do not use advertising cookies.
  </p>

  <h2>Third parties</h2>
  <p>
    We load web fonts from Google Fonts, which may involve a request to Google's
    servers to deliver the font files. We do not share personal information with
    third parties for advertising.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy as the product evolves. Material changes will be
    reflected by the "last updated" date above.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about privacy? Reach us at
    <a href="mailto:privacy@wyzer.io">privacy@wyzer.io</a>.
  </p>

  <hr />
  <p>
    This page describes how the site works today and is provided for
    transparency. It is not legal advice.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
